      "sourceFeatureExtractionItemID": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I support this. I think blocking a world should be a personal preference that gives users more control over what they want to see without negatively affecting the world or the people who enjoy it.\n\nI especially like the idea of showing a warning instead of completely preventing someone from joining a blocked world. If a friend invites me there, I can still choose to join if I want to.\n\nI would also want an easy way to view my blocked worlds and unblock one if I change my mind.\n\nOverall, I think this gives users more control over their own experience without taking that choice away from anyone else.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
  ],
  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2026-10-29T20:05:02.338Z",
  "deleteID": null,
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Users should have the freedom to hide content that upsets them, regardless of the context.\n\nGiving users the ability to curate their own worlds tab to hide offensive content places the responsibility and the tools necessary to make choices that can only be made on an individual case-by-case basis in the hands of the individual.\n\nImplementation:\n\nAdd a \"Block World\" button in the list of options when looking at a world on the page that shows instances on the right.\n\nAdd a \"Blocked Worlds\" tab similar to the \"Blocked Users\" tab.\n\nHide the location of any user on Blue or Green who is in a world you've blocked.\n\nWarn users when they are about to accept an invite or join an instance in a world they have blocked.\n\nSpoken Language / Live Play Example:\n\n\"So how would it work if you block a world and you want to join someone who is using that world you blocked, you won't be able to join them or how would this solution work exactly?\"\n\nYour friend, who is on green or blue, will have their location hidden. If you receive or request an invite from that user, you will see the world name appear as normal/part of the invite. When you hit the checkmark to accept the invite, an additional pop-up will appear. \"You are about to join a world you have blocked. Are you sure you want to join?\"",
